  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>From the kinetic interpretation of temperature, we know, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>K</mi><mi>E</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><msub><mi>k</mi><mi>B</mi></msub><mi>T</mi></math>. Clearly, it depends only on temperature.</p>",
